      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Central Spark contacted me the day after Solar Quotes provided my details. On-site inspection conducted within 2 days. Quotes for two different systems provided within a day.I decided on a 9.99kw system, with Winaco Gemini 370 panels x27, Fronius Primo 8.2 single phase inverter and Fronius DataManager,  Fronius smart meter. Panels on the north and west of the house.I was guided through the process of getting the Government rebates. Installation completed within two weeks of signing the quote which was fantastic given the lead up to Christmas.Central Spark employ their own installers, no sub contracting which gave me confidence in the company and they are located 30 minutes away, so local. Installers arrived as scheduled and were so professional and polite. Incredibly neat installation, cabling etc in conduit.Installer made sure I had downloaded the correct app to monitor the system.Electrical inspection and connection to grid organised within a week and a half.Now enjoying lots of free electricity and sending heaps back to the grid. My only regret is that I didn’t install solar sooner!",
