      "review_description": "Matt and his team were professional from the start.Excellent communication, from offering a variety of component options to suit my install through to talking me through his design process were simply fantastic.On the day of the install they arrived when scheduled and throughout the install they left my property in a tidy matter.Post install, they were very throughout with showing us around our brand new system and highlighting important safety procedures.All in all, the install is super clean with nothing unnecessary exposed, all wiring very neat and clearly labelled, and as a package looking like the well designed system it is with nothing tacked on as an afterthought.Would recommend Matt and his team to anybody asking, best of the bunch.Cheers,Fiona & Daniel",
