      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Matthew and his team are a pleasure to see at work, well organised, clean installation, basically invisible, the cable conduits are put in places where you can only see them if you go look for it. But that's not why we chose Central Spark. I know with the software available today it's easy to draw up a potential plan from behind a desk and make up a very informative, if not a colourful quote. but you can't beat an installer that will take the time to visit your property to look at things and discuss how and where to install things. That's Central Spark Victoria. Matthew answered every question, made the paperwork a breeze (rebate, interest-free government loan, etc...). We also appreciate their punctuality in this weird Covid 19 season. Things got done and done well. I'd go out and take some photos but the weather is rubbish and there's really little to see: Panels are up a 2 story roof, Inverter next to the fusebox, cabling and conduits well out of sight. Neat!",
